 s flight MH370. Betty Thompson is an Edinburgh native and the winner of Lei
 cester Square Theatre Sketch Off 2026 and has a semi-serious office job\, s
 o is only doing this show for three dates at this year's Fringe. Nicole is 
 a creation based on the love of the enigmatic Edinburgh girly. Please come.
